<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>*Can be used in roblox Magic Training
It allows you to cast the spell fast by using this macro (types "/incarcerous Enter")

Incarcerous, the Incarcerous Spell, is a common incapacitation spell used to temporarily bind the victim, preventing them from neither moving nor using any magical ability until it wears off.
Incarcerous can be reversed through the use of either Relashio or Diffindo, however the former will cause the target to lose their wand if they happen to have it equipped.

-Spell Type
Stun
-Effect
Binds the victim with rope.
-Clashes
All
-Incantation
Incarcerous
-Spell Speed
Normal
-Number of Casts
1(3)
-Cooldown
0
(Magic Training Wiki)</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
